{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49081","headline":"摊破浣溪沙 一 · 南唐嗣主李璟","name":"摊破浣溪沙 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"菡萏香销翠叶残，西风愁起绿波间。\n还与韶光共顦顇，不堪看。\n细雨梦回鸡塞远，小楼吹彻玉笙寒。\n多少泪珠何限恨，倚阑干。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"南唐嗣主李璟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49081.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49081","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《人间词话》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/人間詞話）"}